<title>UK: LME copper stable, nickel vulnerable in pre-market.</title>
<headline>LME copper stable, nickel vulnerable in pre-market.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Little changed from Wednesday's strong close at $2,533. LME stocks draw of 3,550 tonnes supportive. ALUMINIUM - Touch easier but still above $1,640. NICKEL - Barely lower at $7,240/$7,260, but seen vulnerable to downside. ZINC/LEAD - Stable.</p>
</text>
